{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 SECOND DEATH \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no coming back from the lake of fire\u2026 unless you bring the fire yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of a cursed jungle, a cannibal cult thrives under the rule of a deranged prophet. His compound is a fortress of madness. His followers are armed, fanatical, and hungry. You\u2019ve been hired to end it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate the cult leader. Destroy his compound. Survive the jungle. Get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 FEATURES \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tFull Story Campaign \u2013 Dive into a brutal narrative of survival, vengeance, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tArcade-Style Action \u2013 Fast-paced combat with retro flair and modern polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tExclusive Levels \u2013 Battle through handcrafted stages filled with secrets and escalating danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tEnhanced Graphics &amp; Audio \u2013 Crisp visuals and immersive sound design for maximum impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tOptimized Performance \u2013 Smooth gameplay across a wide range of systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tGamepad Rumble Support \u2013 Feel every explosion, impact, and jungle ambush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996120?t=1761611660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996120?t=1761611660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996120/e5b086